# Packages CI builds from deploy tags and publishes to kabilan108.cachix.org,
# by pname, slowest build first. ci/cache-targets.py finds each one's exact
# derivations in the sietch and jacurutu systems.
#
# Only free software that no trusted cache has. Left out on purpose:
# - unfree packages (NVIDIA, CUDA builds, Slack, Chrome,
#   firmware): a public cache must not redistribute them;
# - ghostty: ghostty.cachix.org has its flake's builds;
# - plain downloads (bun, gogcli) and cheap builds.
